  "description": "One day, while barely holding on day by day, my mother developed dementia. I had to shoulder the entire burden of caring for a mother who could not even recognize her own child. As my mother's condition worsened and the hellish days with no end in sight continued, a mysterious email arrived.\n\n \"I will make your mother disappear.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852270), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14383313)",
